sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor Client as User / API client
participant API as API service
participant Controller as TemperatureAverageReportsController
participant ReportService as GetTemperatureAverageReportService
participant StationService as GetStationByIdService
participant StationRepository as IStationRepository / MongoWeatherStationRepository
participant MeasurementRepository as IMeasurementRepository / MongoMeasurementRepository
participant Mongo as MongoDB Atlas

alt daily average
  Client->>API: GET /stations/:stationId/reports/temperature/daily-average
else weekly average
  Client->>API: GET /stations/:stationId/reports/temperature/weekly-average
end

API->>Controller: route with JWT user
Controller->>ReportService: execute({ stationId, window })
ReportService->>StationService: execute({ stationId })
StationService->>StationRepository: findById(stationId)
StationRepository-->>StationService: station

alt station not found
  StationService--xReportService: Error("Station not found")
  ReportService--xController: propagate
  Controller-->>Client: 404 Not Found
else station found
  StationService-->>ReportService: station
  ReportService->>ReportService: compute moving UTC window<br/>daily 24h, weekly 7d, ending now
  ReportService->>MeasurementRepository: averageTemperatureForPeriod({ stationId, from, to })
  MeasurementRepository->>Mongo: aggregate measurements by stationId and reportedAt range
  Mongo-->>MeasurementRepository: average value and sample count, or none
  MeasurementRepository-->>ReportService: average and sampleCount
  ReportService-->>Controller: TemperatureAverageReport
  Controller-->>Client: 200 TemperatureAverageReportDto
end

Note over Mongo,ReportService: Averages read only persisted measurements manual and openweather<br/>no call to ingestion or OpenWeather on this path
Note over ReportService,Controller: An empty period is still a 200 response with average.value null and sampleCount 0
